# arvo-refit

Re-export crate for the bit-width refit trait family (`Narrow` and
`Widen`). Trait declarations and impls live in `arvo-bits-contracts`
(orphan-rule constraint: trait + foreign-primitive impls share a
crate). The `arvo` facade pulls this crate to expose `Narrow`,
`Narrowed`, `Widen`, `Widened` at the top level. `#![no_std]`, no
alloc.
